    "mapping_notes": [
      "Complete publisher-edition poem (PTS/BJTS), not a line-complete translation of every VRI stanza. Whole-poem correspondence does not imply segment, line or word equivalence. Preserve independent VRI wording, peyyāla, variant notes and edition differences; do not invent missing words or transfer another poem’s refrain.",
      "Publisher main PTS heading395, BJTS brace/file398, and canonical tha-ap400 are distinct literal identities; no general numbering rule is approved.",
      "Retain publisher Salaḷamaṇḍapiya, source-note2 BJTS salala, and VRI Saḷalamaṇḍapiya spellings without harmonization. Source-note5 botanical spelling rezin remains unchanged.",
